          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Transforming inventory into impact.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Want to learn more about reprocessing with Stryker's Sustainability Solutions (SSS)? Let’s connect at CleanMed! The SSS team will be onsite in St. Louis from <b>May 12</b>&nbsp;to <b>May 14&nbsp;</b>at the <b>St. Louis Union Station Hotel</b>.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Visit us at booth #19 in the exhibit hall to learn more about our comprehensive reprocessing program.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a href=\"#contact\">Schedule dedicated time</a> with our leadership team to discuss your facility needs and learn how we can help support you.</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Apr 07 2026 19:51:51 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
